Error [E0927]: `#Uninit` isn't a known applied rule
  --> tests/ui/E0927_retired_marker.jet:6:6
    |
  6 |     #Uninit label: String
    |      ^^^^^^
 Why: `Uninit` isn't registered as an applied rule — Jet rules are a closed, registered vocabulary (I7), not any PascalCase word.
 Fix: Check the spelling, or see Docs/spec/syntax-decisions.md for the full applied-rule list.
